      *<META VARIOUS-ITEMS>                                                     
      * For Reads                                                               
      *    - All fields will be populated                                       
      *    - When BZXOJNA0-In-DB-All, and eof reached on Live db, a             
      *      Get-1st/Get-Next will be done on the History table.  The           
      *      interface will then return BZXOJNA0-In-DB-Hist.  Continue          
      *      with function Get-Next and BZXOJNA0-In-DB-Hist.                    
      *    - When BZXOJNA0-In-DB-Flag is blank, default.  Default               
      *      action is read on only Live                                        
      *                                                                         
